---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Cookie Policy | kitcheck.cc"
  description="Cookie policy for kitcheck.cc. What cookies and storage we use, and why."
  canonical="https://kitcheck.cc/cookies/"
>
  <SiteHeader>
    <a href="/" class="btn-primary">Use the calculator</a>
  </SiteHeader>

  <section class="bg-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-2xl pt-16 md:pt-18 lg:pt-20 pb-12 md:pb-14">
        <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-text-light mb-5">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-text-mid transition-colors">kitcheck.cc</a>
          <span>›</span>
          <span class="text-text-mid">Cookie policy</span>
        </nav>
        <h1 class="font-head text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-text mb-4">
          Cookie policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-text-mid leading-relaxed">
          Last updated: April 2026
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-bg border-t border-border">
    <div class="container py-14 md:py-18">
      <div class="max-w-2xl prose-custom">

        <h2>What this page covers</h2>
        <p>
          This page explains what cookies and browser storage kitcheck.cc sets, what they
          are used for, and how you can control them.
        </p>

        <h2>Your consent preference</h2>
        <p>
          When you first visit kitcheck.cc, a banner asks whether you are happy for us to
          use analytics cookies. Analytics are off by default and only turned on if you
          click Accept.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your choice is saved in browser local storage under the key
          <code>kitcheck-consent</code>. It has no expiry date but is cleared if you
          clear your browser data for this site.
        </p>
        <p>
          To change your choice, clear the <code>kitcheck-consent</code> entry from your
          browser's local storage and reload the page — the banner will reappear.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics cookies (optional)</h2>
        <p>
          These cookies are only set after you accept. They are provided by Google
          Analytics 4 (GA4) to help us understand how people use the calculator.
        </p>

        <div class="cookie-table-wrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Cookie</th>
                <th>Purpose</th>
                <th>Expires</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><code>_ga</code></td>
                <td>Distinguishes unique visitors</td>
                <td>2 years</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><code>_ga_FSYJ9GNCNP</code></td>
                <td>Maintains session state for this GA4 property</td>
                <td>2 years</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p>
          Google Analytics uses anonymised IP addresses. The data collected includes pages
          visited, approximate location (city level), device type, and referral source.
          No personally identifiable information is stored.
        </p>

        <h2>No other cookies</h2>
        <p>
          kitcheck.cc does not set any other cookies. There are no advertising,
          social-media, or tracking pixels on the site.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party resources</h2>
        <p>
          The site loads fonts from Google Fonts. Google may set its own cookies or
          collect data under its own privacy policy when serving these fonts.
        </p>

        <h2>More information</h2>
        <p>
          See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a> for full details on how we handle
          data. If you have questions, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:privacy@kitcheck.cc">privacy@kitcheck.cc</a>.
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SiteFooter />
</Base>

<style>
  .prose-custom h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-head, inherit);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose-custom p,
  .prose-custom ul {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-mid);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prose-custom a {
    color: var(--color-coral);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .prose-custom a:hover {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
  .prose-custom code {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    background: #f3f4f6;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .cookie-table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
  th {
    text-align: left;
    font-family: var(--font-head, inherit);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-text-mid);
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  td {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-mid);
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
</style>
